    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_sprite" kindref="compound">Sprite</ref> for the shadow of the airship.</para>
<para>Actually, the shadow is made of two 16x16 shadow sprites in the System file drawn on top of each other. These are blit to an intermediate bitmap and cached until the system graphic is changed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
